{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016HX35hkxTjGqYJhJ7KntBh","type":"tool_result","content":"5:## Notes from the harness build\n17:## 2026-11-01: harness built by uw-harness 0.3.0 with claude\n# Implementation log\n\nOne entry per significant change: date, what changed, what was learned, what is left.\n\n## Notes from the harness build\n\n- All existing PHPUnit suites (`mantis`, `soap`, `rest`, `mantis core formatting` in `phpunit.xml`) boot `core.php` and need an installed instance with a database. `soap` and `rest` also need a web server. They run only in the full gate (`composer run check` through `build/local_instance.sh test`). On 2026-11-01 they passed locally: 744 tests, PHP 8.5.3, MySQL 8.0 in Docker.\n- The fast gate runs a new database-free suite, `tests/Unit` with `phpunit.unit.xml`. It loads single files (`core/classes/*.class.php`, `core/constant_inc.php`, `config_defaults_inc.php`, `lang/strings_english.txt`) without `core.php`.\n- There was no PHP linter. `build/lint_php.sh` runs `php -l` on tracked PHP files. No coding-standard tool (phpcs, phpstan) was added, because there is no agreed rule set in the repository.\n- `build/check_lineterm.php` is not in any gate: with options it rewrites files.\n- `build/ci_install_mantis.sh` uses `declare -A` and needs bash 4. macOS ships bash 3.2, so `build/local_instance.sh` sends the same installer request with curl itself. It reuses `build/ci_post_install.sh` unchanged.\n- MantisBT's `mysqli` driver always connects to port 3306, so `compose.yaml` maps MySQL to host port 3306.\n- `npm run api:generate` runs `npm ci` in `tools/scalar` and `tools/bruno`, so the full gate needs network access. The fast gate does not.\n- PostgreSQL support in `compose.yaml` and `build/local_instance.sh` (`DB_TYPE=pgsql`) was written but not run during the harness build.\n- The existing CI matrix in `.github/workflows/mantisbt.yml` was not changed. `uw-harness verify` runs in a new workflow, `.github/workflows/harness.yml`, with PHP 8.1 and Node from `.nvmrc`.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"82dc10bc-3ef3-4b72-8fde-fd8fb913756e","uuid":"28c76478-1ae0-458e-93a1-ee66ed18f57c","timestamp":"2026-11-01T23:01:06.845Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"5:## Notes from the harness build\n17:## 2026-11-01: harness built by uw-harness 0.3.0 with claude\n# Implementation log\n\nOne entry per significant change: date, what changed, what was learned, what is left.\n\n## Notes from the harness build\n\n- All existing PHPUnit suites (`mantis`, `soap`, `rest`, `mantis core formatting` in `phpunit.xml`) boot `core.php` and need an installed instance with a database. `soap` and `rest` also need a web server. They run only in the full gate (`composer run check` through `build/local_instance.sh test`). On 2026-11-01 they passed locally: 744 tests, PHP 8.5.3, MySQL 8.0 in Docker.\n- The fast gate runs a new database-free suite, `tests/Unit` with `phpunit.unit.xml`. It loads single files (`core/classes/*.class.php`, `core/constant_inc.php`, `config_defaults_inc.php`, `lang/strings_english.txt`) without `core.php`.\n- There was no PHP linter. `build/lint_php.sh` runs `php -l` on tracked PHP files. No coding-standard tool (phpcs, phpstan) was added, because there is no agreed rule set in the repository.\n- `build/check_lineterm.php` is not in any gate: with options it rewrites files.\n- `build/ci_install_mantis.sh` uses `declare -A` and needs bash 4. macOS ships bash 3.2, so `build/local_instance.sh` sends the same installer request with curl itself. It reuses `build/ci_post_install.sh` unchanged.\n- MantisBT's `mysqli` driver always connects to port 3306, so `compose.yaml` maps MySQL to host port 3306.\n- `npm run api:generate` runs `npm ci` in `tools/scalar` and `tools/bruno`, so the full gate needs network access. The fast gate does not.\n- PostgreSQL support in `compose.yaml` and `build/local_instance.sh` (`DB_TYPE=pgsql`) was written but not run during the harness build.\n- The existing CI matrix in `.github/workflows/mantisbt.yml` was not changed. `uw-harness verify` runs in a new workflow, `.github/workflows/harness.yml`, with PHP 8.1 and Node from `.nvmrc`.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_016HX35hkxTjGqYJhJ7KntBh","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgd3GzpW76hUvCfyWyLxZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01G4zVW2nejM3Qvha4sqve4J","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat >> docs/harness/log.md <<'EOF'\n\n## 2026-11-02: global categories in category commands, REST ignores `status` (issue #32470)\n\n- Changed: `CategoryAddCommand`, `CategoryUpdateCommand` and `CategoryDeleteCommand` accept project id 0 (ALL_PROJECTS), with the same check as `CategoryGetCommand`. Delete rules did not change. The commands no longer read a `status` payload field: only `enabled` sets the category status. `status` was removed from the `ProjectCategoriesAdd` and `ProjectCategoriesUpdate` schemas in `api/rest/mantisbt_openapi.yaml`. Tests added in `tests/Mantis/CategoryCommandTest.php`, `tests/Mantis/CategoryDeleteCommandTest.php` and `tests/rest/RestProjectCategoryTest.php`.\n- Learned: no SOAP or UI caller passes `status` to the category commands. Only REST payloads could reach it, so removing it does not change SOAP. `helper_parse_id()` rejects 0, so ALL_PROJECTS must be checked before it is called. `CategoryGetCommand` uses `== ALL_PROJECTS`, which in PHP is also true for a null project id; the new code uses `is_numeric()` and a strict check instead. `composer run check` stops the web server when it ends, so to run REST tests with `--filter` after it, use `build/local_instance.sh test --filter ...`.\n- Left: `CategoryGetCommand` still treats a missing `project_id` as ALL_PROJECTS (loose comparison). Not changed here.\nEOF\ncomposer run check-fast 2>&1 | tail -3; git status --short","description":"Add log entry and rerun fast gate","timeout":300000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1111,"cache_read_input_tokens":70607,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1111}